[{"client_msg_id":"652c7f0f-5531-4f7b-baad-8df5ac78a4cd","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"`c` はほぼ意味がないケースになってるっぽいので無視していただいて。。。","ts":"1637852360.409500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sw3z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7bb395fe-0776-42ed-b8f8-7fe2aa536c0d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これ、b の ipairs が印字されない。つまり配列扱い受けてなさそう。","ts":"1637852333.409000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6SBp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"325d267d-2d5f-421a-bd27-b7873f62e3c8","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```local a = { 'foo', 'bar', 'baz' }\ntable.remove(a, 1)\nfor i, v in ipairs(a) do\n  print('a:ipairs', i, v)\nend\nfor i, v in pairs(a) do\n  print('a:pairs', i, v)\nend\n\nlocal b = { 'foo', 'bar', 'baz' }\nb[1] = nil\nfor i, v in ipairs(b) do\n  print('b:ipairs', i, v)\nend\nfor i, v in pairs(b) do\n  print('b:pairs', i, v)\nend\n\nlocal c = { [1] = 'foo', [2] = 'bar', [3] = 'baz' }\nc[1] = nil\nfor i, v in ipairs(c) do\n  print('c:ipairs', i, v)\nend\nfor i, v in pairs(c) do\n  print('c:pairs', i, v)\nend```","ts":"1637852314.408700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OPonZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ff3cfba-9158-4603-997f-4045b551e2bf","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"お。うがさんの主張を後押しするかもしれない実験結果が。","ts":"1637852311.408500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fd9rZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D444B475-5F2E-4BB2-869C-D4563DA141AF","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"ほー、辞書(文字列キー)かちゃんとした配列しか受け取れないんですね","ts":"1637852256.408000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jd89"}]},{"client_msg_id":"760e968d-c0a1-4585-b423-4cc0ec0b9c95","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これをやるとこのエラーがでるので、neovim における Vim script とのブリッジにおいては未定義らしい","ts":"1637851160.407100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0ZhW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b3fa96f-9bc2-4bf8-9de8-b77688d886b4","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"`E5100: Cannot convert given lua table: table should either have a sequence of positive integer keys or contain only string keys`\n```lua\u0026lt;\u0026lt;EOF\n_G.arr = function()\n  local a = { '1', '2', '3' }\n  a[1] = nil\n  return a\nend\nEOF\n\nechomsg luaeval('_G.arr()')```\n","ts":"1637851128.406400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IXsp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B0D425C7-FC7E-44C2-B103-857D70792C4E","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"よし。強気に行きます","ts":"1637850217.406100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KhXN7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff3869e8-1699-4ec4-8ac7-6a6cd5a5e061","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"```let a = v:null\nlua print(vim.g.a)\n=\u0026gt; vim.NIL```\nでした","ts":"1637850134.405200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LI1R9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d34feca-254c-4497-b98e-3ce2b52ba937","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"みたいですね","ts":"1637850106.404500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U90"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C1B7F96D-9D77-4F19-8B17-212D55B0E81B","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"多分vim.NIL","ts":"1637850064.404000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fiPMx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AB184D7F-6072-4B7C-9783-F6C63B0EFD1B","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"v:nullとnilって対応してないですよね","ts":"1637850031.403600","edited":{"user":"U02AJP5L75Z","ts":"1637850143.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IbF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E888366A-DBE0-4260-90E8-B5CCA598525A","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"この関数名前がvim.tbl_islistなので…","ts":"1637849915.403200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lu93"}]},{"client_msg_id":"574FBD91-623B-42AC-8E2A-454EF490D8FF","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"配列として扱っているtableに=nilやる方が悪い(table.remove使って)という気持ちです","ts":"1637849817.402600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bk0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae8115d1-e728-4c54-a92d-3f95aed0c737","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"今度から使わせてもらおう","ts":"1637848494.400400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H/onl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d03babe-7f2f-4e0f-9b74-72bfb6665494","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"違反するとランタイムエラーが発生するだけの interface 機構が存在する。","ts":"1637848488.400200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ahv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fbd8ccba-0456-48f1-828d-74e149ce97fd","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"懐が深い、いいな 好きだ","ts":"1637848488.400100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BHI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ebdb581-02c2-45bd-9be5-708ab6d08821","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"PHP は懐が深いから。。。","ts":"1637848469.399600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k0c6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21f12cc1-b8da-490b-a1f9-f3199b49ba26","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```local a = { '1', '2', '3' }\ntable.remove(a, 1)\nprint(vim.inspect(a))```\nこれなら `{ '1', '2' }` が印字されます。","ts":"1637848435.399300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"etd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5028685-8b7e-4802-a6ca-98d3aec26477","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"PHP「歯抜けでも、数字と文字列がキーに混じってても、キーが文字列だけでも、配列は配列です(ｷﾘｯ」","ts":"1637848431.399200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yamaiyatsu","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uCP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c330b64f-4de2-423c-8f3a-5ca8ff26e92e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```local a = { '1', '2', '3' }\na[1] = nil\nprint(vim.inspect(a))```\nこれをやると、\n```{\n  [2] = \"2\",\n  [3] = \"3\"\n}```\nこれが印字されて、ほ、ほ〜って思いました。","ts":"1637848402.398300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bCx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ce1626d-3787-4e44-b097-e3fa5c5abafc","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"でもちょっとびっくりしますよね。自分も kuu さんがおっしゃっているやつを想像するかもしれない。","ts":"1637848329.397400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1oq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74c73e1f-5973-4d99-8e8a-c56514b50e42","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"言語ごとにこのへんの仕様が微妙にずれてるので吸収するの難しい","ts":"1637848314.397100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bA5gt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa6360ac-0ecf-437f-a6b2-5074a67b05ae","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"Lua 的には一応 `{ ['2'] = 'a', ['3'] = 'b' }` の区別があるはずなので、うがさんがおっしゃってることもわかるし、どうすれば。。。というｗ","ts":"1637848268.396300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R+8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55eb9f46-0c03-4e1e-b9ab-241b93c87892","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`{'2': 'a', '3': 'b'}`となるのが自然な気がします、それが嬉しいかは置いておくとして","ts":"1637848163.395400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j2I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cf00d71-9677-4c0b-a8e6-908fb27f9782","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"{ [2] = ‘a’, [3] = ‘b’ } を Vim script に渡したときに `[v:null, 'a', 'b']` になってほしいかどうかってことですよねえ。","ts":"1637848068.394300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7VT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dfe8c650-8ab8-4d81-8511-fa9c148b7172","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"array likeがどういうお気持ちなのか分からないので何とも言えませんが","ts":"1637847888.393500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ESo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46f4e190-264a-4d83-b0de-8586943290d7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Luaのリファレンスにも歯抜けは配列じゃないですよーって書いてありますね","ts":"1637847870.392900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5jbh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47260b21-425a-4448-87e4-df35adb2e71d","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"キーが1からの連番になっていないと配列として扱うべきじゃないと思うんですが","ts":"1637847576.392000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ieQc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97fa3050-28a7-4cde-8a8f-454437a141f5","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"array-like tableの解釈がどうも違うようなので意見欲しいです。\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/16422\u003e","ts":"1637847516.391100","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/16422|#16422 fix(shared): use valid EmmyLua annotations \u0026amp; fix(shared): fix lax checking of vim.tbl_islist\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/16422|#16422 fix(shared): use valid EmmyLua annotations \u0026amp; fix(shared): fix lax checking of vim.tbl_islist\u003e","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"status:needs-discussion, lua","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"8","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim|neovim/neovim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1637740025}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u025p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7ab0f6c-e4b8-4487-9edd-4d847b335cf0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"再現手順がさっぱりなんですよね","ts":"1637817103.389500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q4+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ebc3b5e0-6638-4e74-b227-061d2f695ae4","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"はい、突然死します","ts":"1637817077.389100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2H4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"002D06D0-4BAE-4064-9FA7-19A15830C145","type":"message","user":"UBDMG6N2J","text":"nvim プロセスが突然死するのです？","ts":"1637815121.388800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nXNd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2000ac56-3b41-48ee-9a08-d9eab143bef8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"原因がさっぱり、再現手順もさっぱり","ts":"1637811908.388000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pv9D="}]},{"client_msg_id":"57bf02f6-d36f-49a9-b12b-926f369db7ff","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"Neovimでターミナルを使うと、何かしらの表紙で突然死することが多くて困っている","ts":"1637811860.387600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H4w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43f3e595-3f5d-413d-8111-283ef1d1ee4d","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"ある程度nvim-lspの機能が枯れてきて、nvim-lspのAPIを生かした各種拡張プラグインが揃ってきてからが本番だと思っています。\n僕は現状ちょっとどんなものか試してみようという気持ちなので、vim-lspにいつでも戻せる状態で試してますけど。","ts":"1637797894.386700","edited":{"user":"U80CX6XDZ","ts":"1637797925.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U011FTGJ3SN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jTKE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bca721b7-c449-42ef-9c9d-4a3b7e198848","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"なるほど","ts":"1637797725.384500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kvw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74596ab5-62ef-4656-9290-cd055882fbd0","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"完成度の高さは先発のvim-lspにどうしても劣ってしまいますからね","ts":"1637797677.384300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h5fS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ced30d18-59be-40e0-bc97-3eaea9537eff","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"だから未完成な部分が目に付くのでしょう","ts":"1637797657.383700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O1qT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbe0673b-c2b7-41dd-85ab-e4c0344f61ac","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"現在でも頻繁にアップデートが入っておりぜんぜん枯れた機能ではないのです","ts":"1637797648.383300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HlESB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07c77dd6-7362-4512-a68a-bfdb8179926f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"本体に入っている意味はちゃんとあります","ts":"1637797623.382700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zO32="}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea6a736f-f73f-49a8-a8a5-9139476a5183","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"なので現状細かいアップデートが必要なフェーズであれば、別プラグインであることの優位性がありますが、ある程度動作が安定した断面であると、IFが保証された本体同梱であることのメリットが生きてくる気がしますね。","ts":"1637797617.382400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ULt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60ced9fa-5baa-44c9-ab27-bd59272e3bea","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"はい","ts":"1637797610.382000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SENh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"854bfe35-67a2-418c-9b39-0226ddc32da7","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"\u0026gt; どうせ別にプラグイン入れる必要あるなら本体に入れる意味あったん？ってずーっと思ってる\n本体に入れる意味はちゃんとあって、nvim本体のAPIからlsp経由で取得した情報が取れるようになっているのでそのためだと思っています。\n現状ってvim-lspの出力を受けとってなにかするプラグインあるんですけど。vim-lspの内部関数をコールしているだけなのでAPIとして明示されているものを受け取っているわけではないんですよね。僕もそうでしたけど、prabirshresthaさんの実装みてこうすればハックできるっているのを真似してる感じなので。\nnvim-lspは公式側からlspから取れるのはここから取ってくれと言ってるわけです。","ts":"1637797341.380600","edited":{"user":"U80CX6XDZ","ts":"1637797556.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Upma"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a468ea0-21a9-43be-ad31-456f9c190257","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ちょろっと試したけど結局vim-lsp-settingsをやめられなかった","ts":"1637796449.380000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kRs2="}]},{"client_msg_id":"33c4540d-d2f6-40a2-830d-ad0ce41a4687","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"tree sitterなどとは訳が違うと思うんだけど、全然追ってないので分からんな","ts":"1637796398.379300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9RG=V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b11e2f0b-017b-4c30-8d54-78175d88cd01","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ネイティブAPI的なのって触ってないんでしたっけ、builtin LSP","ts":"1637796343.378400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fmCqu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"177bd15c-3d2b-4d7c-9a55-363c1c55b662","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"どうせ別にプラグイン入れる必要あるなら本体に入れる意味あったん？ってずーっと思ってる","ts":"1637796299.377500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["U011FTGJ3SN","U01U44T1FK2","U8R597E9H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fd7bN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6e6aaee-f707-40bc-82f3-f3f1e0514972","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"nvim-lsp使って一週間くらい経ちましたがvim-lspと比較してやはり体感的に早くなっている気がしますね。ただ全体的な動きの安定感はvim-lspに結構な軍配が上がる印象でした。特にdiagnosticsが更新されるタイミングが謎なことが多くてちょっと難儀してます。Macで使っていると本体ごと更新しない限りアップデートできないのもちょっと辛いですね。brewさん。。。","ts":"1637794866.375900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FlX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4BAE28E3-253C-480D-A143-2D1CCF4D3739","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"なるほど…","ts":"1637788237.373000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SVpS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5fe1ccb2-de1e-4750-8ba2-eb5a0a82b884","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"はい、その回避策は知っていたのですが、どうやら、関数名というよりFuncref がうまく扱えずにエラーを吐いてるみたいなんですよね。Iussueでもluaっぽくかけるようにしてほしいっていう要望があがっていましたが、あまり乗り気では無さそうで…","ts":"1637786723.372800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w/4I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43E8F288-0BF6-4C0A-B0EC-567F612092E2","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"#が入ってるって話ならvim.fn[\"hoge#huga\"]()でいけますよ","ts":"1637785372.367800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ki4E"}]}]
